  "b4_text_layer_sanitized": "95\nThe order of energy absorbed which is responsible for the color of complexes (A)\n[Ni(H2O)2(en)2]2+ (B) [Ni(H2O)4(en)]2+ and (C) [Ni(en)3]2+ is\n(1)\n(A) > (B) > (C)\n(2)\n(C) > (B) > (A)\n(3)\n(C) > (A) > (B)\n(4)\n(B) > (A) > (C)\nCoordination Compounds\n",
