  "b6_reason": "Energy absorbed equals the crystal field splitting, and en is a stronger field ligand than water, so splitting rises with the number of en: 3 en > 2 en > 1 en.",
  "b6_working": "(C) [Ni(en)3]2+ has 3 en, (A) [Ni(H2O)2(en)2]2+ has 2 en, (B) [Ni(H2O)4(en)]2+ has 1 en, so delta and hence absorbed energy order is C > A > B",
